---
/**
 * The mark beside the name: an "m" and the prompt's green cursor, white on
 * black. Drawn in HTML so it shares the page's font; the favicon is the same
 * mark rendered to an image in src/og/favicon.ts, with the same proportions.
 */
---

<span
  class="inline-flex size-[1.375em] shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-[0.2em] rounded-[0.17em] bg-black ring-1 ring-edge leading-none text-white"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
  <span class="text-[0.86em]">m</span>
  <span class="h-[0.67em] w-[0.24em] bg-pl-green"></span>
</span>
